  "0bf90571-9e69-e34b-a73d-2f9b6902565e"],
 "\[LineSeparator]makes a 1D HammingKernel for filtering k-space. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"b330df3e-8565-d241-b926-5325f3d961da"],
